#- §5╔═.✵.════════╗    §2ᴇᴍᴇʀᴀʟᴅ ᴘʀɪɴᴄᴇꜱꜱ:            ᴘᴀʀᴛ ᴏɴᴇ
§5╚════════.✵.═╝
§2By the time she was around 200 years old, Fern had already made an impression and a name for herself with the many heroic deeds she’d either stepped up to or created by accident...
#- §2Tales were being passed around with every drop of Bert Beer. Also the question of whether Fern even aged at all. She certainly grew, but isn’t that what flowers do anyway?

These stories made their way further and further beyond the now fully formed

#- §2civilisation. No longer the wasteland the wandering villagers first discovered. Rumour travelled fast and reached the pointed ears of 
an elf named Castien Morlana. His precious family heirloom had been stolen and he could only think of one name for the job of retrieving it. 
#- §2After reading the pleading note, Fern happily obliged. After three days' ride she met Castien in a small village tavern called ⚜The Spyglass⚜. 

“So what can you tell me about what’s missing?” she asked politely while sipping nectar from a tankard. 
#- §2“§cThat’s not from other flower people is it?§2” the elf pondered. “Don’t be ridiculous… it’s my own nectar”. Castien paused for a moment to stop himself gagging informally. 
“§cMy family are very wealthy, and have an entire vault filled to burst with the most exquisite jewels, gems and stones from all
#- §cover the land.§2” Fern looked up intrigued. “§cThe thief came in the night, somehow broke into the vault, and left with only one thing§2”. Fern tilted her head even more intrigued...
         §6 _..+.._ 
       (^\/^\/^)
        \§2@.*@*@§6/
         {__.__}
------------------ 
 §2“§cThe Emerald Crown!§2”
#- §2Fern nearly choked on nectar and her resident bumblebee Honey fainted. “Wait… the crown, emerald, crown, emerald…the…”. “§cYes, that crown§2” 
said Castien almost smirking. “When we’re you going to tell me I was in the presence of royalty?” Castien reached over, plucked Honey out of the
#- §2tankard and carefully dried the bee with a napkin. “§cI found it rather pleasant, not being recognised for once, you of all people can understand that... 
I’m sure.§2” 

Fern rolled her eyes at him but felt deeply embarrassed inside... “I’ll find the crown!” 
#- §2To be continued…
§5✿✿❀❀❀✿✿.✿✿❀❀❀✿✿

