     §8/warp kitshop
§6└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘
§cToday's (long-awaited for the person that submitted it) warp is a lovely general goods shop. Hidden away in an underground lair of some kind, the stand-out feature is the rather impressive collection of heads, tools, books and
#- §cominous banners. 
I spotted the old beloved classics like §5Craftlife Magazine 
§cand the first §8I Will Survival: A Craftadia Song! §c(ah the memories of seeing my little song again). The shops themselves are scattered around in separate areas and the owner is considerate enouth to 
#- §cprovide their contact information should they run out of stock. /warp corner or mmmgay take you too... §6well... §cumm... the §6corner of this world §cwhere more shops are available. I'd §6heard stories §cthat Craftadia was §6trapped §cinside an §6ancient magical barrier. §cI heard it 
was made to trap 
#- §6something terrible inside. §cAnyway, maybe that's a tale for another day... 

Overall this is a decent warp that has a nice variety of items! My only small critique would be the great open space that makes it a little harder to find shops right away.

#- §6┌───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┐
    §8I give this warp:
       §6★★★★☆ 4.0
└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘
